		<category><![CDATA[Massive Monkees]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Massive Relief]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://bluescholars.com/blog/?p=778</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[
Massive Relief w/ Massive Monkees was a massive success! Two benefit shows in one day, 10K in funds raised for the Philippine typhoon relief effort. You also might&#8217;ve seen your guy getting interviewed on the news on Sunday. Thank you to everyone who came through. If you didn&#8217;t you can still donate to the relief [...]]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-779" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="03" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/03.jpg" alt="03" width="500" height="332" /></p>
<p><strong><a href="http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/10/oct-18-blue-scholars-x-massive-monkees-typhoon-ondoy-benefit-concert/">Massive Relief</a></strong> w/ <strong>Massive Monkees</strong> was a massive success! Two benefit shows in one day, 10K in funds raised for the Philippine typhoon relief effort. You also might&#8217;ve seen your guy getting interviewed on the news on Sunday. Thank you to everyone who came through. If you didn&#8217;t you can still donate to the relief effort. Hit up <a href="http://bayanusa.org/?page_id=252">BALSA for more information</a>. More photos forthcoming.</p>
<p align="left"><a class="tt" href="http://twitter.com/home/?status=Check+@bluescholars+MASSIVE+RELIEF+%3D+MASSIVE+SUCCESS+http://tinyurl.com/yl35z7y" title="Post to Twitter"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-twitter-micro3.png" alt="Post to Twitter" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://digg.com/submit?url=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/10/massive-relief-massive-success/&amp;title=MASSIVE+RELIEF+%3D+MASSIVE+SUCCESS" title="Post to Digg"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-digg-micro3.png" alt="Post to Digg" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/10/massive-relief-massive-success/&amp;t=MASSIVE+RELIEF+%3D+MASSIVE+SUCCESS" title="Post to Facebook"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-facebook-micro3.png" alt="Post to Facebook" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://www.myspace.com/Modules/PostTo/Pages/?l=3&amp;u=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/10/massive-relief-massive-success/&amp;t=MASSIVE+RELIEF+%3D+MASSIVE+SUCCESS&amp;c=%3Cp%3EPowered+by+%3Ca+href%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Frichardxthripp.thripp.com%2Ftweet-this%22%3ETweet+This%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E" title="Post to MySpace"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-myspace-micro3.png" alt="Post to MySpace" /></a></p>]]></content:encoded>
