		<description><![CDATA[
Inspired by Sabzi&#8217;s recent analog film excursions, I dusted off this old Nikon FE sitting in a box in the garage, loaded it with some T-MAX 800 film and brought it to the Goorin Bros. Seattle grand opening party we performed at last Saturday. The girl who processed the film at Walgreens gave me a [...]]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-761" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="goorin00" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/goorin00.jpg" alt="goorin00" width="500" height="331" /></p>
<p>Inspired by <strong>Sabzi&#8217;s</strong> recent analog film excursions, I dusted off this old Nikon FE sitting in a box in the garage, loaded it with some T-MAX 800 film and brought it to the <strong>Goorin Bros. Seattle grand opening party</strong> we performed at last Saturday. The girl who processed the film at Walgreens gave me a fat discount because it took them 80 minutes to process my &#8220;One-Hour Photos.&#8221; Win.</p>
<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-768" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="goorin09" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/goorin09.jpg" alt="goorin09" width="500" height="331" /></p>
<p><strong>Dominique</strong> and <strong>Jamie</strong>, our gracious hosts and sexy-hat connoiseurs.</p>
<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-762" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="goorin02" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/goorin02.jpg" alt="goorin02" width="500" height="331" /></p>
<p>Hella hats.</p>
<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-763" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="goorin03" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/goorin03.jpg" alt="goorin03" width="500" height="331" /></p>
<p>This place has cool lighting.</p>
<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-765" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="goorin05" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/goorin05.jpg" alt="goorin05" width="500" height="331" /></p>
<p>Nambu.</p>
<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-766" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="goorin04" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/goorin04.jpg" alt="goorin04" width="500" height="331" /></p>
<p>Vitamin D, dressed like he works here.</p>
<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-767" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="goorin08" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/goorin08.jpg" alt="goorin08" width="500" height="331" /></p>
<p>You look great in that hat. *Gulp*</p>
<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-769" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="goorin06" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/goorin06.jpg" alt="goorin06" width="500" height="331" /></p>
<p>Hello.</p>
<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-770" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="goorin07" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/goorin07.jpg" alt="goorin07" width="500" height="331" /></p>
<p>Cassius&#8217;s no-alcohol streak is still alive.</p>
<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-771" style="border: 1px solid black;" title="goorin01" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/10/goorin01.jpg" alt="goorin01" width="500" height="331" /></p>
<p>I gotta step my manual focus game up.</p>
<p align="left"><a class="tt" href="http://twitter.com/home/?status=Check+@bluescholars+PHOTOS%3A+Goorin+Bros.+Seattle+Grand+Opening+http://tinyurl.com/yksh4u4" title="Post to Twitter"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-twitter-micro3.png" alt="Post to Twitter" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://digg.com/submit?url=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/10/photos-goorin-bros-seattle-grand-opening/&amp;title=PHOTOS%3A+Goorin+Bros.+Seattle+Grand+Opening" title="Post to Digg"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-digg-micro3.png" alt="Post to Digg" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/10/photos-goorin-bros-seattle-grand-opening/&amp;t=PHOTOS%3A+Goorin+Bros.+Seattle+Grand+Opening" title="Post to Facebook"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-facebook-micro3.png" alt="Post to Facebook" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://www.myspace.com/Modules/PostTo/Pages/?l=3&amp;u=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/10/photos-goorin-bros-seattle-grand-opening/&amp;t=PHOTOS%3A+Goorin+Bros.+Seattle+Grand+Opening&amp;c=%3Cp%3EPowered+by+%3Ca+href%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Frichardxthripp.thripp.com%2Ftweet-this%22%3ETweet+This%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E" title="Post to MySpace"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-myspace-micro3.png" alt="Post to MySpace" /></a></p>]]></content:encoded>
